  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "MFGNet-Gear",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMFGNet-Gear: A Synthetic 3D Dataset for Geometric Defect Detection in Gears\n\t\n\nThis mirror contains mesh files only (.ply format, ~11 GB).\nFor the full dataset including point clouds (.txt, ~30 GB), download from:\nDeep Blue Data \u2014 DOI: 10.7302/qrdj-n812\nFor code, documentation, and data generation scripts, see the\nGitHub repository.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Overview\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nProperty\nValue\n\n\n\t\t\nTotal parts\n24,000\n\n\nGear designs\n12 (T20\u2013T40 series)\n\n\nQuality classes\n4 (G0, P0, W0, R0)\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/rsmei/MFGNet-Gear.",
